Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:03.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}CHIEF OJI AND THE WORLD OF DREAMS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.01,0:00:07.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We somehow managed to finish on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:09.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:14.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We have some time left\Nuntil the Shinkansen arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}GIFT SHOP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:18.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll grab some gifts for my employees,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:21.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}as well as something for the divisions{\i0}\N{\i1}we always work with.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:24.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This looks pretty good...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:28.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And something for Masumi, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:34.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You don't see Naruto-kun{\i0}\N{\i1}lost in thought very often.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:36.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is he deliberating over?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:40.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's got his hands on something cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:42.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:48.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Cute things? Hmph!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.84,0:00:50.93,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}HMPH
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:51.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm only interested in real cats!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.43,0:00:54.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now I'm curious...{\i0}\N{\i1}This isn't the Naruto-kun I know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:55.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There are plenty of{\i0}\N{\i1}other options for gifts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:00.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:03.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:06.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It wouldn't be right to interfere.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:24.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}UNCLE'S OBSESSION WITH CUTE THINGS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:44.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll be heading out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.29,0:02:48.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:52.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Naruto-kun's been leaving{\i0}\N{\i1}pretty early lately.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:59.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, Masumi's there already?{\i0}\N{\i1}I should get going, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Glance, glance...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not here after all...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:14.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who am I looking for?{\i0}\N{\i1}The kitty, of course, but also...{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.19,0:03:18.66,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}TA-DAH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:18.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nii Masumi-kun,{\i0}\N{\i1}who helped me out last time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:22.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}During my business trip,{\i0}\N{\i1}I found a cute gift with a cat on it,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:27.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I bought it, in case I managed to meet{\i0}\N{\i1}Nii-kun again at the same park.{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.63,0:03:33.71,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}SWEAT
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:33.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would he think that's creepy?!{\i0}\N{\i1}I realize it very well could be!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:37.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I happened to come across{\i0}\N{\i1}the perfect gift by pure coincidence,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:41.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I got it in case we happened to{\i0}\N{\i1}coincidentally meet at this park again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:44.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not like I'm dying to{\i0}\N{\i1}give him this gift!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:45.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not at all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.31,0:03:52.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should go home...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:56.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that you, Naruto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:03:59.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:03.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,N-Nii-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:06.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you looking for\Nthe cat from the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.29,0:04:10.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't think I'd actually run into him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.88,0:04:15.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.\NBut it doesn't seem to be around today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, Nii-kun.\NI have this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:26.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I was on a business trip recently,\Nand bought these cute cat cookies for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:29.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't a big deal,\NI happened to have some gifts left over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:32.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Just to give out if I happened\Nto run into you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:33.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll gladly take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:39.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Nii-kun, are you meeting up with someone\Nagain here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.36,0:04:41.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right. My uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:47.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me. It's from Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:50.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,My uncle... It's from Uncle...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.29,0:04:53.50,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}UNCLE (OJI)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:54.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His uncle? From Uncle?{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.50,0:04:55.25,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}UNCLE (OJI-SAN)
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.25,0:04:56.75,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}OJI-SAN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:56.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oji-san?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:59.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way it's him!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll be going now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:04.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Naruto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:08.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.77,0:05:14.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No, it's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:16.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's not true at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:21.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nii-kun... Even if you run into hardship{\i0}\N{\i1}after entering society,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:23.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}please remain pure as you are now!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:29.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Tonight's restaurant was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.25,0:05:32.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a real winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? Isn't that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:44.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, this? I happened to run\Ninto someone I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:47.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You know, the one I met at the park\Nthat I mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:50.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, the one shrouded in mystery...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:54.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Going shopping with someone{\i0}\N{\i1}you met at the park,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:59.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and then receiving a gift from them...{\i0}\N{\i1}What are the chances of {\i0}that{\i1}?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:04.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We live in the age of social media.{\i0}\N{\i1}Maybe it's possible? Still...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:07.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're cookies.\NLet's try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:13.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aren't these the same ones that Naruto-kun{\i0}\N{\i1}bought on our business trip?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:17.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How do you two know each other again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:22.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How? When you put it that way...\NI'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.55,0:06:27.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,He seemed to be in a spot of trouble,\Nso I just helped him a little.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.59,0:06:28.14,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- JU!\N- There, there. How cute. Yep, so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:33.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see? That makes no sense at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:38.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But wouldn't that make you two\Nbasically total strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:43.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't follow people you don't know\Nor accept things from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:46.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:51.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But I didn't follow him to go shopping.\NI was the one who invited him, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:53.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That makes even less sense!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I guess that's fine, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:07:00.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Masumi... What kind of life{\i0}\N{\i1}are you leading in college?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 2,0:06:59.54,0:07:00.92,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:05.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that man's name is Naruto-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:08.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,He happens to wear glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:11.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wear glasses?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:16.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This gift in a cat motif tin,{\i0}\N{\i1}and now glasses...{\i0}
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.64,Font2,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:19.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could it be Naruto-kun?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:21.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm Naruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.02,0:07:24.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Masumi and Naruto-kun know each other?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.11,0:07:25.57,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm Naruto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, there's no way that's true!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:31.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lots of people in that business district{\i0}\N{\i1}wear glasses and go on similar trips!{\i0}
Dialogue: 2,0:07:28.95,0:07:30.70,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm Naruto...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or not...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:39.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he worried about me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:49.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:52.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.10,0:07:55.56,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}TAKING A BATH
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:54.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:04.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I put it out of my mind for a while{\i0}\N{\i1}to stop the butterflies in my stomach...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:10.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But tomorrow's the day of the Kit D Land{\i0}\N{\i1}stage show advance performance!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.24,0:08:10.20,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}SQUEAL SQUEAL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:13.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After the results came out,{\i0}\N{\i1}if the tickets arrived by mail...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:17.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"How do I explain these tickets{\i0}\N{\i1}addressed to me?!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:21.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I can't have Masumi see them!"{\i0}\N{\i1}or so I thought...{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.25,0:08:20.37,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}INVITATION TICKETS ENCLOSED
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank goodness they're e-tickets.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:36.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so nervous,{\i0}\N{\i1}I don't think I can sleep...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:43.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today's the day!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:47.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm here at the Kit D Land amusement park!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.61,0:08:53.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won pair tickets.{\i0}\N{\i1}So of course I'm not here alone...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:57.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm glad the weather's nice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:08:59.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I came with my nephew.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:01.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Mama, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.67,0:09:02.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.00,0:09:06.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,F-For two...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:13.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The tickets you got from someone at work\Nwere e-tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.35,0:09:17.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Things are so convenient now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:23.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After much agonizing about who to invite,{\i0}\N{\i1}my first choice turned me down...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:26.19,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:29.86,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But that date is right before\Na deadline at work...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:36.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I considered going alone,{\i0}\N{\i1}but these early tickets are hard to get.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:38.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't possibly leave a seat empty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:42.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ended up relying on Masumi again...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:48.34,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I received some tickets to Kit D Land...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.58,0:09:51.59,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}BA-DUMP BA-DUMP
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.34,0:09:49.51,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Care to join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:50.67,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.01,0:09:51.67,Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\pos(10,146)}JUST LIKE THAT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:51.67,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:56.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I worked up the resolve to invite him,{\i0}\N{\i1}but he didn't make a big deal about it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.85,0:09:59.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Getting inside was a smooth process...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:02.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now I'm finally here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:06.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the world of Pugtaro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:11.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, Uncle. Look, some mascot characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:11.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:16.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:20.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What about Pugtaro?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:28.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right. I'm not going to run into{\i0}\N{\i1}Pugtaro so easily...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:31.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uncle, should we take this opportunity\Nfor some photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:34.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's do it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:38.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Photos... like these...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:41.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's do it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.56,0:10:45.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, hold on.{\i0}\N{\i1}Is it okay to take him at his word?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:47.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What if he's ribbing me{\i0}\N{\i1}like a kid in college would...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:51.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? Really? "Let's do it"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:52.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I was kidding. You're so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:54.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that's what he says?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:59.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to! I want to so badly!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:02.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:06.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I being tested by Masumi right now?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:08.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But one photo can't hurt...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:10.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:12.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Lots of families here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:16.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I missed my chance for photos!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:19.68,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That said...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:21.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter where I look...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:22.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All around me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:27.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No matter where I go,{\i0}\N{\i1}I'm surrounded by cute things!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.15,0:11:33.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we lived closer,{\i0}\N{\i1}I'd love to buy an annual pass!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:40.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kit D Land characters!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:43.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So gosh-darn cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:50.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With so many kids around, I better not{\i0}\N{\i1}stare in case people think I'm a creep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:58.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Being here alone in this cute park with{\i0}\N{\i1}all these kids would be overwhelming.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:01.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I want this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:04.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,C'mon, why can't I get one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:08.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uncle, Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:12.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uncle, should we go for it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.44,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}CHARACTER GLASSES
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:14.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Masumi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:16.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They also had these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:19.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I supposed to do here?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:23.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Should we go for it?"{\i0}\N{\i1}Of course I'd love to!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:27.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know they serve no use in my{\i0}\N{\i1}regular life, but I still want them!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:33.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what's the right answer here{\i0}\N{\i1}as an uncle?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.09,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's buy some!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:40.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How's this?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:43.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Since we came all this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:44.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There we go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:47.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.43,0:12:48.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Then this one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:51.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's gotta be Pugtaro!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.73,0:12:53.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:55.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's a little embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:13:00.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never thought I'd be able to{\i0}\N{\i1}flaunt Pugtaro merch like this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:01.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:06.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Where to next?\NShould we try some rides as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:11.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't mind the idea of rides, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:13.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uncle, you don't like going on rides?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:16.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's not the case, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:18.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Actually, I couldn't sleep last night...{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.80,0:13:24.80,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PANT PANT | SQUEEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:23.72,Font2_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Kit D Land tomorrow!\NI get to meet Pugtaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:28.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm running on practically no sleep,{\i0}\N{\i1}and my heart's beating a little fast...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:31.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know these rides are for kids,{\i0}\N{\i1}but I really shouldn't get on one.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:34.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's check out something else, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, should we grab some food?\NAren't you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:48.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that, but I'm too nervous to eat...{\i0}\N{\i1}Still, the packaging's so cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:52.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, it's almost time...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:54.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here we go.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.46,0:13:59.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The annual affair that is{\i0}\N{\i1}Kit D Land's stage show.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.05,0:14:02.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One day...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd always dreamed of going one day...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.64,0:14:09.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now I'm finally here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.27,0:14:14.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he really not feeling well today?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:19.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is where they hold the shows?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The staff member is saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:27.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Footage of this show may be uploaded to\Nour social media accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:29.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Social media!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No one told me about this!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:33.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, no! It says it right here{\i0}\N{\i1}on the application form!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.62,0:14:35.46,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}CAUTION: FOOTAGE OF THE SHOW MAY BE\NUPLOADED TO SOCIAL MEDIA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should have looked closer!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.46,0:14:37.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I can't show up on camera!{\i0}\N{\i1}Oh, no! Oh, no!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:41.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something I can use to hide myself!{\i0}\N{\i1}Um, um...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:44.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:48.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,S-Since I bought these and all,\NI figured I should make good use of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:52.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sure, but...\NCan you see in those?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:53.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:54.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:04.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never knew he could make{\i0}\N{\i1}funny jokes like that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll wear mine, too!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.32,0:15:09.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop. Let's calm down.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.37,0:15:12.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I lost my composure and ended up{\i0}\N{\i1}acting weird in front of Masumi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:15.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides, I worked up the courage{\i0}\N{\i1}to apply for these tickets!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:19.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if they upload anything{\i0}\N{\i1}to social media, it'll be a tiny image!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:22.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The chances of anyone recognizing my face{\i0}\N{\i1}are slim to none!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:26.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to forget about that{\i0}\N{\i1}and enjoy my time here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:32.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know that, but the stress is real,{\i0}\N{\i1}and I don't wanna show up on social media!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:38.52,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Is it starting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:44.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here we go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:47.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh? What now? Who's up next?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:56.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pugtaro!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:00.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A-A-Amazing!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:04.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've only seen Pugtaro on merch until now,{\i0}\N{\i1}but now he's alive right before me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:05.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This can't be real!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:08.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, I need more air.{\i0}\N{\i1}Deep breaths...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:16.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uncle, are you okay?!\NYou don't look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:19.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me and enjoy the show, Masumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:22.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't pass out from lack of oxygen here!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:26.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Regain your composure.{\i0}\N{\i1}Who cares about social media?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:29.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:32.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:37.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.91,0:16:35.62,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(VOICE INSIDE MIND)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:43.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We have a special show\Nprepared for you today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.09,0:16:45.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th-They're talking!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:54.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're all dressed up for the occasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:56.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:59.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So cute!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.16,0:17:13.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're singing!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:31.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,All together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:38.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And dancing, too?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:49.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ann-chan's way more nimble than she looks!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:55.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th-This is so much fun!{\i0}\N{\i1}I don't believe it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:57.74,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The same goes for this park,{\i0}\N{\i1}but this show is for kids.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:01.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even so, the stage set is intricate,{\i0}\N{\i1}and draws you into the Kit D Land world!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:06.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pugtaro really exists!{\i0}\N{\i1}Or that's what it feels like, anyway!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:09.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Honestly, I have no idea{\i0}\N{\i1}what I'm saying anymore!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.63,0:18:12.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never thought I'd get to see this...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:16.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to be moved to tears!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.52,0:18:21.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The kids...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:23.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did I miss something?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:32.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all coming down into the audience!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.28,0:18:34.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way. I didn't know they'd do that...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:38.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was having fun here in the back,{\i0}\N{\i1}but now I wish I was in the front!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:42.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where's Pugtaro? He disappeared{\i0}\N{\i1}from the stage before I realized it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.66,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}TAP
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:47.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.11,0:19:16.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The show was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What should we do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:25.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What? We're outside the auditorium?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:27.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was it all a dream?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:30.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, Masumi just said the show was fun...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A lapse in memory?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that's a first...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:39.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I try to remember{\i0}\N{\i1}what happened in the show...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:44.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just have vague memories{\i0}\N{\i1}of how much fun it was!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:48.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At first, I tried hard not to{\i0}\N{\i1}let my excitement show...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.85,0:19:51.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it was a lost cause as soon as{\i0}\N{\i1}Pugtaro came up to me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:54.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was grinning like an idiot for sure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:56.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, not much I can do about it now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:19:59.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure Masumi must have seen it, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:04.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if he saw me acting giddy, my one{\i0}\N{\i1}hope is to blame it on the theme park!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.12,0:20:12.25,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}MENACING
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:12.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe he's seen through my lies{\i0}\N{\i1}about receiving these tickets for free!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:16.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uncle, let's look around the gift shop\Nand head back before it gets late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:20.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:23.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He may have said that he enjoyed the show,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:27.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but this isn't a place a boy in college{\i0}\N{\i1}would enjoy visiting alone with his uncle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.27,0:20:32.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uncle seemed pretty tired today,{\i0}\N{\i1}so it'd be best for him to rest soon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.69,0:20:36.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel a little sorry now for making him{\i0}\N{\i1}hang out with me all day...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Are you getting gifts for your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.15,0:20:42.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, you're right.\NMaybe I'll buy them some.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.12,0:20:47.58,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}AFTERWARDS
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:47.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pugugugu...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:54.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a great day this was.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:56.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Too bad I didn't get a single photo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:21:00.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And my mental training for{\i0}\N{\i1}when I meet Pugtaro did me no good...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.51,0:21:02.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But along with the Pugtaro glasses,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:06.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I got Pugtaro gifts{\i0}\N{\i1}for both Kenta-kun and myself!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:11.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he feeling okay?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:14.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's get something to eat\Nbefore we head home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.15,0:21:15.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.07,0:21:22.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uncle, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.87,0:21:24.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:26.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A photo from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:31.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Masumi, you got a photo?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:35.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, now I wish I'd taken one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.09,0:21:36.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I have more, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.50,0:21:37.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:38.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:41.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.09,0:21:43.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ta-dah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:47.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:52.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I-I thought there were no photos\Nallowed of the stage show...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.77,0:21:56.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh? They said it was okay to take photos\Nafter the show was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.36,0:21:59.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Really?! I want that photo!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:22:00.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll send them over later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.61,0:22:06.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My guardian angel...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.99,0:22:09.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Masumi-sama!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.58,0:22:10.50,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's me, Masumi-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's get the most expensive things\Non the menu today!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.21,0:22:17.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No need to hold yourself back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:19.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh? Uncle, weren't you feeling sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:22.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I feel healthy as a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:25.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, right. Since you're twenty now,\Nhow about some alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:26.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:32.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:34.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:37.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today was really, really fun!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.52,0:22:41.49,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THE NEXT DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.52,0:22:40.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:47.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After getting too carried away,{\i0}\N{\i1}I ended up laid up in bed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:51.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So you really {\i0}were{\i1} feeling sick!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:55.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry! I'm so sorry!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:08.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.85,0:23:15.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The water feels so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.65,0:23:18.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You two look completely different...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:23.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Pug...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.00,0:23:35.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So your fur gets like that when it's wet?

